# Build output, not source: 50 MB of TGA at authoring resolution, roughly ten
# times the size anything renders at. The PNGs beside them are the source art,
# and images/parts/export_tga.py rebuilds these from them at any time. The
# addon's own shipped textures are made by tools/ and land in GoblinPS/Media/.
